#. ja: <set-time $n1><num $year>/<num $month>/<num $day> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>
#. de: <set-time $n1><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>
#. fr: <set-time $n1><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> <num $hour>h<num2 $min>
#. macro: <set-time $n1> — sets the time placeholders ($hour, $day, …) to a Unix time; time = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $year> — a number; value = year of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $month> — a number; value = month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $day> — a number; value = day of the month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $hour> — a number; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num2 $min> — a number with at least two digits, such as 05; value = minutes of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "Addon:14061:0:0"
msgid "<set-time $n1><num $year>/<num $month>/<num $day> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>"
msgstr "<set-time $n1><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>"

#. ja: <set-time $n1><num $year>/<num $month>/<num $day> <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if>
#. de: <set-time $n1><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if>
#. fr: <set-time $n1><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>h<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>pm<else>am</if>
#. macro: <set-time $n1> — sets the time placeholders ($hour, $day, …) to a Unix time; time = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $year> — a number; value = year of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $month> — a number; value = month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $day> — a number; value = day of the month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num2 $min> — a number with at least two digits, such as 05; value = minutes of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "Addon:14062:0:0"
msgid "<set-time $n1><num $year>/<num $month>/<num $day> <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if>"
msgstr "<set-time $n1><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>PM<else>AM</if>"

