#. ja: 栽培委託の依頼には、<br>1日毎にシェルダレースクリップ:青船貨<num $n1>枚がかかります。<br>栽培委託中は、種まきから収穫までを魔法人形が行い、<br>最大で50個の収穫物をストックしておくことができます。<br>費用は、依頼時と（地球時間）<reset-time 17><if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時毎に、<br>自動的に支払われます。<br>※すでに当日分が支払われていた場合、追加費用はかかりません。<br><br>栽培委託を依頼してよろしいですか？<br><br>依頼後、以下の状況になった場合は栽培委託が停止されます。<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>　・種まきの際、種の所持数が0だった場合<br>　・シェルダレースクリップ:青船貨が不足し、<br>　　費用の支払いができなかった場合<br>　・収穫数が50個に達した場合<br>※再開が可能な状態になると、自動で栽培委託は再開され、<br>　再開時に費用が支払われます。<br>※栽培委託により、魔法人形が収穫を行った場合は、<br>　開拓経験値を獲得することはできません。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Der Saatplan wird dich täglich <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauri<else>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauris</if> kosten.<br>Solange der Saatplan in Kraft gesetzt ist, wird die Marionette sich um die Pflanzen kümmern. Bis zu 50 Stücke Erntegut eines jeden Beetes kann sie lagern. Die Kosten für den Plan werden beim ersten Bestätigen und danach täglich um <reset-time 17><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr (Erdenzeit) automatisch bezahlt. Hast du für einen Tag bereits bezahlt, fallen keine weiteren Kosten an.<br>Fortfahren und den Saatplan in Kraft setzen?<br><br>※ Der Plan wird abgebrochen, wenn:<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>・ du nicht genügend blaue Cieldaläen-Kauris hast.<br>・ die Grenze von 50 Stücken Erntegut erreicht ist.<br>※ Sobald du genügend Kauris bzw. die Erzeugnisse abgeholt hast, werden dir die Kosten berechnet und der Plan automatisch fortgesetzt.<br>※ Wird die Ernte von einer Marionette durchgeführt, erhältst du keine Inselroutine.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Vous pouvez confier une parcelle à un cultivateur pour <num $n1> assignats insulaires azur par jour, jusqu'à un maximum de 50 récoltes.<br>Les honoraires sont débités lors de la demande de culture, puis une seule fois par jour à <reset-time 17><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h (temps réel).<br><br>Voulez-vous confier la parcelle à un cultivateur<nbsp>?<br><br>La culture sera interrompue dans les cas suivants<nbsp>:<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>- Stock de graines épuisé.<br>- Vous manquez d'assignats insulaires azur.<br>- Limite de 50 récoltes atteinte.<br>* Une fois les conditions remplies, la récolte et le paiement reprendront au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment.<br>* Lorsqu'une parcelle est confiée, les poupées magiques s'occupent de la récolte. Aucun point d'expérience insulaire ne vous sera attribué.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <reset-time 17> — sets the time placeholders to the next daily or weekly reset; hour = 17 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:14326:0:0"
msgid "The produce producer requires a daily fee of <num $n1> seafarer's cowries to provide gardening services, which will be collected at the time of request and then at <reset-time 17><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (Earth time) each day thereafter. Daily fees are only charged once.<br><br>A team of mammets will sow seeds, water plants, and collect a yield of up to 50 per crop.<br><br>Entrust the produce producer with care of the following crop?<br><br>※Care will be halted in the following circumstances:<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>　・Seafarer's cowries are insufficient.<br>　・Yields have reached the maximum of 50.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※Care and associated fees will resume automatically once required conditions have been met.<br>※Yields harvested via the gardening service will not provide island EXP."
msgstr "Услуги садовника обойдутся в <num $n1> морских каури в день. Плата списывается при заказе, а затем ежедневно в <reset-time 17><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 по земному времени. За день плата взимается только один раз.<br><br>Мамметы посеют семена, польют растения и соберут до 50 единиц урожая с каждой грядки.<br><br>Поручить садовнику ухаживать за этой грядкой?<br><br>※Уход приостановится, если:<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>　・не хватит морских каури;<br>　・урожай достигнет предела в 50 единиц.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※Когда условия будут выполнены, уход и списание платы возобновятся автоматически.<br>※За урожай, собранный садовниками, опыт острова не начисляется."

